CLASS net/minecraft/world/item/SimpleFoiledItem
	METHOD isFoil (Lnet/minecraft/world/item/ItemStack;)Z
		COMMENT Returns {@code true} if this item has an enchantment glint. By default, this returns {@code stack.isEnchanted()}, but other items can override it (for instance, written books always return {@code true}).
		COMMENT
		COMMENT Note that if you override this method, you generally want to also call the super version (on {@link Item}) to get the glint for enchanted items. Of course, that is unnecessary if the overwritten version always returns {@code true}.
		ARG 1 stack
